      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Four years later:\n\nLena: 19 + 4 = 23\nOmar: 13 + 4 = 17\n\nTotal: 23 + 17 = 40\n\nTheir total today is 32. It rises by 2 × 4 = 8 because two people each gain four years.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
