    "teach_7": {
      "id": "teach_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "“Years older” gives a fixed gap. It does not mean “times as old.”\n\nIf S is 4 years older than T today, write:\n\nS = T + 4\n\nIf T is 12, then S is 16.",
