      "content": {
        "text": "Check the relationship by subtracting:\n\n16 − 12 = 4\n\nAfter five years, they are 21 and 17. Their gap is still 4. Both ages moved together, so the added five cancels when we subtract.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
